          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP208 Kananaskis Lakes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LOL, I thought I entered this cache AFTER entering 'Smith-Dorrien Trail' Brass Cap into my GPS at 6 something this morning...turns out I entered it ON TOP of my 'Smith-Dorrien Trail' entry.  Good thing I had the scrap of paper with my notes in the truck.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This cap was a quick find when I finally started looking in the right spot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!!  BigR&lt;/p&gt;

